&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 72px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;◎&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 26.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 119.46666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;1.5 法・制度&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 184px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・企業活動に大きく影響する諸制度の改正&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・薬価改定&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 208px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・諸制度改正の早期情報入手と対応策の実施&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・行政への適切な働きかけ&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・薬価改定を受けない製品ポートフォリオの充実&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 64px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;→&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 72px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;○&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 26.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 119.46666666666666666666666667px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;1.6 海外展開、&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;海外グループ会社&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 184px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・社会情勢の急激な変化や戦争・テロの発生&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・諸外国における想定を大きく超える諸制度の改正&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 208px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・情報収集および対応策の早期検討・実施&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・複数拠点からの製品供給体制の構築&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 64px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
